From 7cc9c8d4217f1c24c18702bee58cd2e32d62d14f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:31:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Package the translators the image profile asks for
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_TRANSLATORS was set in every image profile but
build/jam/packages/Haiku never added it to the package, so no translator
ever reached the image (STXTTranslator included). Add the missing
AddFilesToPackage line.

This is why the default desktop background has never appeared: Tracker
installs it at every start, but with no image translator it cannot decode
the PNG. The remaining piece is a PNG translator, which needs libpng for
arm64 (built in prose-packages, but this build resolves packages from the
remote HaikuPorts repository, whose list is checksummed — a local package
needs its own repository definition).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build/jam/packages/Haiku | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/build/jam/packages/Haiku b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
index 173116883c..6ebb5e98a0 100644
--- a/build/jam/packages/Haiku
+++ b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
@@ -395,6 +395,7 @@ AddFilesToPackage add-ons mail_daemon outbound_filters :
 	;
 
 AddFilesToPackage add-ons media : $(SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_MEDIA) ;
+AddFilesToPackage add-ons Translators : $(SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_TRANSLATORS) ;
 
 AddFilesToPackage add-ons Network\ Settings :
 	IPv4Interface
-- 
